 EA's side, I can't finish the game. Buy it somewhere else unless they actually try to fix it. \nBut until that time, I can't recommend buying it here on steam. Which is where this game would have stayed if EA didn't destroy everything they touch.", "timestamp_created": 1594769499, "timestamp_updated": 1594769499, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492395699024200439", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}